    "skyPreset": "golden_alpine_meadow",
    "loreSummary": "Flaggrike is the first settled ground the eastern road reaches out of the port, which makes it the place everything heading further east is provisioned from. It has water that can be taken standing up, a drowned valley head with soil in it, and a passage into the pavement close enough to the road that ore can be got and loaded in the same day."
